Has anyone ever setup two tunnels between two locations, where one
tunnel was encrypted and the other is not encrypted?

=20

There is a patent registered by a company called Fatpipe which is
alleging that no one before 2005 has ever done this, we are looking for
prior art to invalidate this patent.  Doing this has been possible using
openvpn since 2002.

=20

We are willing to pay $10,000 to anyone who can step forward with
validated evidence of such prior art which we can use to invalidate the
Fatpipe patent.

=20

